<title>USA: Key IMM currency futures lower, but peso rallies.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currency futures lower, but peso rallies.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 16 - IMM currency futures were mostly lower in late morning trade, with action in key contracts quiet. Peso rallies. Traders said a Wall Street firm bought 200 Sept real futures and 400 Sept peso futures. An IMM floor analyst said peso recovering nicely after huge losses Tuesday, but said Latam sector choppy.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
